---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro"
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")
---
<Base title="Mene">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="triad">MENE · TEKEL · UPHARSIN</p>
    <h1>The writing on the wall<br />for poisoned packages.</h1>
    <p class="lede">On 8 September 2025 one phished maintainer turned <code>chalk</code> and <code>debug</code> into malware. The warnings lived where they could be edited or deleted. Mene writes them where they can't be.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn primary" href={`${base}/wall`}>Read the wall</a>
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}/check`}>Check your lockfile</a>
      <a class="btn" href={`${base}/docs/action`}>Add to CI</a>
    </div>
    <dl class="counters" id="counters" aria-live="polite">
      <div><dt>Active advisories</dt><dd id="c-active">…</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Witnesses</dt><dd id="c-witnesses">…</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Read at block</dt><dd id="c-block" class="mono">…</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule" />

  <section class="grid3">
    <article class="card">
      <p class="word">Mene</p><h3>Numbered</h3>
      <p>Every advisory is written to Arkiv as a readonly entity, then sealed to the burn address. Not even its author can delete it. <a href={`${base}/docs/data-contract`}>How</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <p class="word">Tekel</p><h3>Weighed</h3>
      <p>Independent witnesses weigh it. Two of three must confirm before it counts, so one hacked witness can neither forge a warning nor bury one. <a href={`${base}/docs/trust-model`}>Why</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <p class="word">Upharsin</p><h3>Divided</h3>
      <p>The poisoned version is cut from your build. Mene matches your lockfile locally and fails CI. No package name ever leaves your machine. <a href={`${base}/docs/action`}>Setup</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <h2>How a warning becomes binding</h2>
  <figure class="card diagram">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 760 210" role="img" aria-labelledby="qd-t">
      <title id="qd-t">Witness A inscribes an advisory; witnesses B and C attest; with two of three confirmations the advisory is ACTIVE and CI fails on a match.</title>
      <g font-family="var(--sans)" font-size="14" fill="var(--text)">
        <rect x="10" y="20" width="150" height="44" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="85" y="47" text-anchor="middle">Witness A inscribes</text>
        <rect x="10" y="83" width="150" height="44" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-2)" stroke="var(--line)"/><text x="85" y="110" text-anchor="middle">Witness B confirms</text>
        <rect x="10" y="146" width="150" height="44" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-2)" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/><text x="85" y="173" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--muted)">Witness C (optional)</text>
        <path d="M160 42 C 230 42, 230 105, 290 105 M160 105 L290 105 M160 168 C 230 168, 230 105, 290 105" stroke="var(--gold)" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <rect x="290" y="72" width="180" height="66" rx="10" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--gold)"/>
        <text x="380" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--serif)" font-size="22" fill="var(--gold)">Arkiv</text>
        <text x="380" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">2 of 3 confirmations</text>
        <path d="M470 105 L560 105" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arr)"/>
        <rect x="560" y="72" width="190" height="66" rx="10" fill="var(--gold)"/>
        <text x="655" y="100" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600" fill="var(--gold-ink)">ACTIVE</text>
        <text x="655" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--gold-ink)">your CI fails on a match</text>
      </g>
      <defs><marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="var(--gold)"/></marker></defs>
    </svg>
  </figure>

  <h2>Thirty seconds to a safer build</h2>
  <div class="grid3 two">
    <div>
      <p class="muted small">Locally</p>
<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/andrew1234-arch/Mene && cd Mene
npm ci && npm run build
node packages/cli/dist/index.js check --lockfile ../app/package-lock.json
# exit 0 clean · 1 poisoned · 2 can't verify (fail closed)</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="muted small">In GitHub Actions</p>
<pre><code>- uses: andrew1234-arch/Mene/action@main
  with:
    lockfile: package-lock.json
    threshold: 2</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Why it's on Arkiv</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Where else</th><th>What breaks</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Our own API or database</td><td>We, or whoever takes over our account, can edit or delete a warning.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>IPFS</td><td>You can't query by issuer or status. There's no ownership and no expiry.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>A subgraph</td><td>It needs a contract plus an indexer someone has to run.</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong>Arkiv</strong></td><td>Typed, queryable attributes; an immutable <code>$creator</code>; readonly entities; Lifetime Extension anyone can pay for; atomic batches. One layer.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 4rem 0 1rem; max-width: 820px; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.18rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 62ch; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: .6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 1.6rem 0 2.2rem; }
  .counters { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0; }
  .counters dt { color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .counters dd { margin: 0; font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--gold); }
  .counters dd.mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 1.3rem; padding-top: .6rem; }
  .word { font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.8rem; margin: 0; }
  .diagram svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
  .two { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); }
</style>

<script>
  import { getTrust, loadWall } from "../scripts/mene"
  const $ = (id: string) => document.getElementById(id)!
  $("c-witnesses").textContent = String(getTrust().issuers.length)
  loadWall()
    .then((w) => {
      $("c-active").textContent = String(w.statuses.filter((s) => s.status === "ACTIVE").length)
      $("c-block").textContent = w.blockNumber.toString()
    })
    .catch(() => {
      $("c-active").textContent = "—"
      $("c-block").textContent = "offline"
    })
</script>
